{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「最強星二代」陳奕迅與徐濠縈的愛女陳康堤（Jasmine），自從進軍樂壇後一舉一動都備受關注。近日，這位樂壇新貴就趁住空檔飛到東南亞度假，更罕有地展現性感與活潑的一面。</p><figure><img alt=\"身穿比堅尼。（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734980883025920782536.png/w1gILy5EnjyMnWCYISAnB7XkY-NZxzab3uqRO97qkTs\"/><figcaption>身穿比堅尼。（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><p>海邊激罕穿比堅尼大騷身材</p><p>從康堤發出的影片片段可見，身在東南亞度假的她心情大靚。她先是換上一套火辣的比堅尼上衣配搭短褲，站在沙灘海邊張開雙臂，對住鏡頭展現招牌的燦爛笑容，大騷健康又sexy的傲人身段。</p><figure><img alt=\"大騷身材。（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734990937296896504693.png/pNGW-cl5bu9G5xLAJs-CQhpQXYRzc1qk8n_gNfJ_4DU\"/><figcaption>大騷身材。（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"sexy！（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734988848402432291657.png/9J6nBjf_Z5hpzCxmJsesBf8gqxteHGZl6SjrZuko62Y\"/><figcaption>sexy！（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><p>隨後，她又體驗了當地的摩托車兜風，坐在後座的她似乎好興奮地對住鏡頭哈哈大笑，全程玩得相當盡興。</p><figure><img alt=\"體驗當地摩托車。（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734986600124416346158.png/CDKG1a5nT3Jintbb6dfU_HIWQgbSk3i0CtClkArQpZA\"/><figcaption>體驗當地摩托車。（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"似乎好興奮！（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734984288931840319578.png/RFgWyGgEqYAvIOrQi6NCHtXL94t1Urh8Jm5gMyZuYDM\"/><figcaption>似乎好興奮！（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154734982002905088210794.png/zzAGnnFtlbQNvtGLYBXlDcjw-LOfFAjRKRgR2CkYEdg\"/><figcaption>（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T09:18:29.796921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}